00:58:53,333 --> 00:58:59,333
A Private War is a 2018 American biographical war drama film directed by Matthew
Heineman, and starring Rosamund Pike as journalist Marie Colvin.

11
01:04:46,666 --> 01:04:52,666
The film is based on the 2012 article "Marie Colvin’s
Private War" in Vanity Fair by Marie Brenner.

12
01:10:40,000 --> 01:10:46,000
The film was written by Arash Amel and features Jamie
Dornan, Tom Hollander and Stanley Tucci.

13
01:16:33,333 --> 01:16:39,333
The film premiered at the 2018 Toronto International Film Festival and
was released in the United States on November 2, 2018.

14
01:22:26,666 --> 01:22:32,666
It received positive reviews from critics, who praised Pike's performance.

15
01:28:20,000 --> 01:28:26,000
At the 76th Golden Globe Awards, the film earned nominations for Best Actress in a Motion Picture – Drama (Pike) and Best Original Song ("Requiem for A Private War"), while
director Matthew Heineman received a nomination for Outstanding Directorial Achievement of a First Time Feature Film Director from the Directors Guild of America.

16
01:34:13,333 --> 01:34:19,333
The film explores themes of journalist, palestinian-israeli
conflict, war correspondent, biography, syria.

17
